        <activityName xml:lang="en">Hard coal power plant, 500MW</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Hard coal power plant, 500MW
Estimation based on literature data for power plants with this capacity.;
UUID: 9e902bb1-834b-3127-9fbe-bf9c1ee1864c
The module includes materials, energy and transport requirements used for construction of the plant. Disposal of material after dismantling is also included.
Location: German data for the end of the 1980s and US data for early 1980s.
Technology: Average technology in 1980s.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: see Geography/Text
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9e902bb1-834b-3127-9fbe-bf9c1ee1864c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
